Travels along a medium trajectory and creates a Solar Flare on impact, dealing up to <pve 63 /> <pvp [20] /> damage and applying <pve 17 /> <pvp [10] /> stacks of <solar Scorch /> to enemies within 5 meters.

The Solar Flare lasts 4 seconds and begins dealing damage after 1 second. It deals <pve 78 /> <pvp [25] /> damage every 0.267 seconds within a 4 meter radius, resulting in up to 13 damage ticks.

